p class=\"prf-lede prf-story\">As of Oct 12, the middle of Jerome County&rsquo;s grids came in under 90% of normal in July to August in 43 of 75 years from 1951 to 2025. In 2025 the middle ran 27% of normal in June to July and 31% in May to June. For 2026 so far, May to June sits at 27% of normal on the middle. Grid 27363 had its driest year in 2013 at 44% of normal.</p>"}
